            </note>
            <note corresp="#d120-f2" n="1" xml:id="d120-f2-content">
                <p>According to Kennedy’s Appointment Book, the meeting began at 6:01 p.m. and ended
                    at 6:17 p.m. (Kennedy Library)</p>
